OL,3,GNEWSAPM tells Stormont parties to be
OL,4,A'realistic' in budget negotiations
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Prime Minister Andy Burnham has
OL,7,Fcalled on the executive parties at
OL,8,FStormont to be "realistic" when it
OL,9,Fcomes to deciding whether to accept an
OL,10,Foffer of extra money to help agree a
OL,11,Fbudget this year.
OL,13,FHe said he had "listened carefully" to
OL,14,Fthem and heard their concerns about a
OL,15,Ffunding shortfall, but added that he
OL,16,Fdid not have "unlimited funds".
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
