OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPM tells Stormont parties to be
OL,4,A'realistic' in budget negotiations
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has offered the
OL,7,Fexecutive #1.5bn over the next three
OL,8,Fyears in extra funding to help
OL,9,Fstabilise its finances, but parties
OL,10,Fhave said it does not touch the sides
OL,11,Fof what they need to break even.
OL,13,FEducation Minister Paul Givan warned
OL,14,Fthat a budget "ultimatum" offered by
OL,15,Fthe Northern Ireland Secretary "isn't
OL,16,Fgoing to bode well for trying to get a
OL,17,Fsettled outcome".
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
